### Ping working edelivery endpoint (eFTI4ALL testbed)
POST {{RUUTER_URL}}/efti/api/v1/gates/ping?gateId=eu-ee32
Content-Type: application/json

> {%
  client.test("Gate pinged successfully", () => {
    client.assert(response.body[0].status === "ONLINE")
  })
%}
